class: abi
profiles: standard
summary: D498 two threads past their prepared stacks at once off Linux write one report line between them, the latch's winner's, and the process ends by its trap
program: program.ldn
c-sources: threads.c
c-args: -pthread
traps: yes
trap_report: program.ldn:12:1: trap: stack_exhausted
run_expect: expected.txt
constructs: 1600, 1610, 1670, 1995, 1996
targets: darwin-arm64, freebsd-x86-64, freebsd-arm64
